    "Encrypt files before they leave this Mac, so the remote only stores data no one can read without your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件在离开这台 Mac 之前先加密，远端只保存没有密码就无法读取的数据。"
