    "File Cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files are decrypted on this Mac as you open or download them, and encrypted as you upload them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开或下载时在这台 Mac 上解密，上传时自动加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files are encrypted on this Mac before they're uploaded (rclone crypt), so the remote only ever stores encrypted data. The password is kept in your keychain. If you forget it, the backup can't be read by anyone — write it down somewhere safe. An encrypted backup needs a new or empty remote folder; any copy of rclone can read it with the same password. Name encryption applies when the backup is first created.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件在上传前就在这台 Mac 上加密（rclone crypt），远端只保存加密后的数据。密码保存在你的钥匙串中。忘记密码后，任何人都无法读取这份备份——请把密码记在安全的地方。加密备份需要使用新的或空的远端文件夹；任何 rclone 只要使用相同密码都能读取。文件名加密设置只在首次创建备份时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files you open are kept here, so opening them again is instant unless they changed on the remote. When the cache is full, the least recently opened files are removed. A custom location gets its own “%@” folder. Edits to cached copies are not uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你打开过的文件会保存在这里，除非远程上的文件已更改，否则再次打开会立即完成。缓存已满时，会移除最久未打开的文件。自定义位置中会创建单独的“%@”文件夹。对缓存副本的修改不会被上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
