            "value": "通过 WebDAV 共享…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shares run while Rclone is open, including when only its menu bar icon is showing. This Mac must stay awake for other devices to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只要 Rclone 在运行（包括只显示菜单栏图标时），共享就会保持开启。其他设备连接时，这台 Mac 需要保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
