          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System files are .DS_Store, ._* files and Spotlight or Trash folders. Add one rclone pattern per line: *.tmp skips those files in every folder, node_modules/** skips a whole folder. Excluded files aren't copied; copies already backed up stay as they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统文件指 .DS_Store、._* 文件以及 Spotlight 和废纸篓文件夹。每行填一条 rclone 规则：*.tmp 会跳过所有文件夹里的 .tmp 文件，node_modules/** 会跳过整个文件夹。被排除的文件不会被复制；已经备份过的副本保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasks are still running. Quit Rclone?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍有任务在进行，要退出 Rclone 吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That folder can't be written to.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法写入该文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download didn't match rclone's published checksum, so it was discarded. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的文件与 rclone 公布的校验值不符，已被丢弃。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The files in this folder are encrypted. Unlock it with its password to browse, open and restore them. They're decrypted on this Mac only as you use them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件夹中的文件已加密。输入密码解锁后即可浏览、打开和恢复；文件只在你使用时才在这台 Mac 上解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local folder “%@” can't be found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到本地文件夹“%@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password is wrong for this encrypted backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个加密备份的密码不正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The passwords don't match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两次输入的密码不一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rclone archive didn't contain the rclone program.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone 压缩包中没有 rclone 程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅限这台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app uses the free, open-source rclone tool to talk to your cloud storage. It isn't installed on this Mac yet. Pick one way to get it:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本应用通过免费开源的 rclone 工具访问你的云存储。这台 Mac 上尚未安装 rclone。请选择一种方式获取："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder is in an encrypted backup. Devices that connect see its files decrypted. Its key is kept in your keychain, so the share works without unlocking the folder first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件夹位于加密备份中。连接的设备看到的是解密后的文件。密钥保存在你的钥匙串中，因此无需先解锁文件夹，共享也能使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes the items from the remote. Folders are deleted with all their contents. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从远程存储中永久删除这些项目。文件夹及其所有内容都会被删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the remote from your rclone configuration. Files stored in the cloud are not touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从 rclone 配置中移除该远程存储，云端存储的文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transfers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "传输"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transfers (%lld running)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "传输（%lld 个进行中）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upload": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upload files or folders here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将文件或文件夹上传到这里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upload to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uploads and downloads appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传和下载会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upload…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This Folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用此文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This rclone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用此 rclone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verifying download…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在验证下载…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for you to sign in with your browser…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待你在浏览器中登录…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WebDAV Shares": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WebDAV 共享"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "on local changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地变化时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "rclone couldn't check the password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone 无法校验密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone couldn't encode the password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone 无法编码密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone didn't start the job.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone 未能启动任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone executable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone 可执行文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone exited with status %d.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone 已退出，状态码 %d。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone isn't installed. Open the main window to install it, or set its location in Settings (⌘,).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装 rclone。请打开主窗口进行安装，或在设置（⌘,）中指定其位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone reported an error.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone 报告了一个错误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone's background service didn't start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone 后台服务未能启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rclone.org has no checksum for %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rclone.org 上没有 %@ 的校验值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the latest rclone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最新版 rclone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” already has files that aren't part of an encrypted backup. Choose a new or empty folder for an encrypted backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”中已有不属于加密备份的文件。请为加密备份选择一个新的或空的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” doesn't hold an encrypted backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”中没有加密备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” holds an encrypted backup. Turn on encryption for this task to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”中是加密备份。请为这个任务开启加密后再使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” isn't available, so the default location is used for now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”不可用，暂时使用默认位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WebDAV Server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WebDAV 服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shared Folders": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享的文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Devices find this folder at the server's address followed by its name, and see it listed at the server's top level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备通过服务地址加上文件夹名称访问它，它也会出现在服务的最上层列表中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share “%@” already has this name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享“%@”已使用这个名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port %@ is already used by another app. Choose another port in the server settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端口 %@ 已被其他 App 占用。请在服务设置中选择其他端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key of the encrypted backup of “%@” is missing. Unlock the folder and share it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”所在加密备份的密钥丢失。请解锁该文件夹后重新共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Devices can also upload, rename and delete files in the shared folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备还可以在共享的文件夹中上传、重命名和删除文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}